      "unit-dummy-3"
    ]
  },
  "_optional": "Art that may legitimately be absent. A key here is skipped by the loader with a console warning rather than a missing-texture error, and every one belongs to a family with a named fallback -- tests/boot.test.ts enforces that. ability-bailey-1 and ability-eli-1 are the two hero slot-1 icons that were not in the upload; every other ability_<hero>_<slot>.webp is present. They fall back to the generated missing-icon stand-in, and dropping the real files in later needs no code change.",
  "_haymakerIcon": "abilities/ability_haymaker.webp is still in the repo and is no longer bound to anything. The ten ability_<hero>_<slot>.webp icons replaced it: every hero's two buttons now draw their own icon, Cory's included, so the whole bar is one scheme rather than one hero's real art beside four placeholders. The placeholders are marked as such and are to be replaced by files with the same names, at which point Cory's button improves with everyone else's. Re-binding the old icon is one line here plus one in heroes.json."
